trical\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Free Electrical Engineering Calculators | Green Engineering Tools\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Voltage drop, wire size, DC cable, three-phase, current conversion and cable-loss tools with transparent engineering assumptions.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/electrical\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Green Engineering Tools\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Free engineering calculators for embodied carbon, CBAM and electrical design.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?icon.1vgxlfe3lamf-.svg\" sizes=\"any\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_5972bc34-module__OU16Qa__className flex min-h-screen w-full min-w-0 flex-col overflow-x-hidden bg-slate-50 text-slate-900\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full border-b border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\"><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex h-16 min-w-0 items-center justify-between gap-2 sm:h-20 sm:gap-4\"><a aria-label=\"Green Engineering Tools home\" class=\"flex min-w-0 max-w-[calc(100%-3.25rem)] items-center sm:max-w-none\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"mr-2 shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 p-1.5 shadow-inner shadow-emerald-700/50 sm:mr-3 sm:p-2\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6 text-white sm:h-7 sm:w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7Z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[15px] font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 min-[360px]:text-base sm:text-2xl\">GreenEngineering <span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Tools</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-4 xl:flex 2xl:gap-6\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/\">LCA</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-sky-600\">Solar ↗</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">LCA Workspace</a></div><div class=\"shrink-0 xl:hidden\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation-panel\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><main class=\"bg-slate-50\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"name\":\"Electrical Engineering Calculators\",\"url\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/electrical\",\"description\":\"Free electrical engineering calculators for voltage drop, conductor size, current conversion and cable power loss.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"Green Engineering Tools\",\"url\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com\"}}</script><section class=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8\"><p class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-300\">Electrical engineering workspace</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-5xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-6xl\">Free electrical calculators for cable, voltage drop &amp; power systems</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">Solve practical DC, single-phase and balanced three-phase calculations without an account. Work in AWG, kcmil or mm², reverse-solve cable length and current, estimate I²R losses and keep the engineering assumptions visible.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-5 py-3 font-black text-slate-950 hover:bg-emerald-400\" href=\"/electrical/voltage-drop-calculator\">Open flagship designer</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-5 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/electrical/methodology\">Read methodology</a></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-18 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/voltage-drop-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Voltage Drop Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Calculate volts lost, percentage drop, receiving voltage, cable resistance and real power loss.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/wire-size-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Wire Size Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Find the smallest standard AWG, kcmil or mm² conductor that meets your chosen voltage-drop target.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/wire-length-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Wire Length Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Reverse-solve the maximum one-way cable run for a conductor, load and allowed voltage drop.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/dc-wire-size-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">DC Wire Size Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Size low-voltage or high-voltage DC conductors for batteries, solar, controls, RV, marine and DC distribution.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/3-phase-voltage-drop-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">3-Phase Voltage Drop Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Balanced three-phase current and voltage-drop calculations using line-to-line voltage and power factor.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/battery-cable-size-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Battery Cable Size Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Plan short high-current battery and inverter DC cable runs with tight voltage-drop targets.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/cable-power-loss-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Cable Power Loss Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Estimate I²R cable loss in watts, annual energy wasted and annual electricity cost.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/watts-to-amps-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Watts to Amps Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Convert active power to current for DC, single-phase AC and balanced three-phase AC circuits.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/electrical/kva-to-amps-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">kVA to Amps Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Convert apparent power to current for generators, transformers, UPS systems and three-phase feeders.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open calculator →</span></a></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-slate-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><article><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-950\">Why one shared electrical engine?</h2><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600\">Voltage drop, conductor size, maximum cable length, maximum current and cable loss are different views of the same circuit. Green Engineering Tools uses one shared calculation engine so the pages do not quietly disagree with each other. The same conductor resistance, temperature, power-factor and parallel-run assumptions follow the calculation wherever you start.</p><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600\">The tool deliberately separates voltage-drop sizing from thermal ampacity. A cable can meet a 3% voltage-drop target and still be unsafe if its installation ampacity, grouping, ambient correction, short-circuit withstand or protection is unsuitable. That boundary is shown instead of hidden.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 p-7 text-white\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black\">Designed for real-world workflows</h2><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300\"><li>• Home and commercial branch-circuit planning</li><li>• Solar DC feeders and battery/inverter cables</li><li>• EV charger circuit voltage-drop studies</li><li>• Motors and balanced three-phase feeders</li><li>• Generator and UPS feeder current conversion</li><li>• Energy-efficiency studies using annual cable loss</li></ul><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"mt-6 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-sky-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-sky-500\">Open Solar Calculator ↗</a></article></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto w-full border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 sm:text-left lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:justify-start\" href=\"/\">GreenEngineering Tools</a><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400 sm:mx-0\">Free browser-based engineering tools for carbon, CBAM, electrical systems and sustainable design.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/electrical\">Explore electrical tools →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Core tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer core tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical Tools</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"block hover:text-white\">Solar Calculator ↗</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Electrical</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer electrical navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/voltage-drop-calculator\">Voltage Drop Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/wire-size-calculator\">Wire Size Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/dc-wire-size-calculator\">DC Wire Size</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/3-phase-voltage-drop-calculator\">3-Phase Voltage Drop</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">LCA learning</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer LCA learning navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\">EPD Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\">EC3 EPD Guide</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Company</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer company navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a></nav></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-800 pt-7 md:flex-row\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs text-slate-500 md:text-left\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Green Engineering Tools. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-center text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500 md:text-right\">Engineering decision-support tools. Formal compliance, certification and site-specific electrical design remain subject to applicable standards, manufacturer data and qualified professional review.</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_